  (:id "schema-elixir-sprint-2026-10-17" :type :work-set :title "Elixir leg: open sprint cards moved to the roadmap (stream schema-elixir)" :note "The 10 open cards of the sprint stream schema-elixir (stream branch sprint/schema-elixir), moved to the roadmap on 2026-10-17 by the owner's ruling: schema languages other than Go leave the sprint. Order: elixir-carries-payload-free-arms-on-the-table-wire, then elixir-carries-the-fixed-class-on-the-table-wire-2, then elixir-answers-the-guard-kind-and-scalar-version-units, then elixir-answers-the-union-arm-version-and-stream-units, then elixir-report-carries-widening-reasons, then elixir-wire-fuzz-every-root, then elixir-rides-the-wire-fuzzer-and-retains-on-every-root-2, then elixir-retain-negative-control, then elixir-fixed-read-beats-its-packet-read, then elixir-generated-code-passes-credo-at-default-strictness. The held sentinel schema-elixir-go-first stays in the sprint store and is not a task." :origin "cards from the sprint store (2026-10-17, epoch 21)" :children ("elixir/elixir-carries-payload-free-arms-on-the-table-wire" "elixir/elixir-carries-the-fixed-class-on-the-table-wire-2" "elixir/elixir-answers-the-guard-kind-and-scalar-version-units" "elixir/elixir-answers-the-union-arm-version-and-stream-units" "elixir/elixir-report-carries-widening-reasons" "elixir/elixir-wire-fuzz-every-root" "elixir/elixir-rides-the-wire-fuzzer-and-retains-on-every-root-2" "elixir/elixir-retain-negative-control" "elixir/elixir-fixed-read-beats-its-packet-read" "elixir/elixir-generated-code-passes-credo-at-default-strictness"))
