  (:id "port/moo/packet" :type :task :title "moo (the deterministic Q48.16 fork of Luau) packet leg: the examples against the shared wire vectors" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/moo/wire_test.go TestMooTypeWireWritesTheGoldens: the fourteen C++-pinned testdata/wire goldens written byte for byte under the pinned moo v1.3.0" "internal/codegen/moo/read_test.go TestMooTypeWireReadsTheGoldens, TestMooTypeWireRefusesTruncation, TestMooTypeWireRefusesHostileValues, TestMooTypeWireWriteRefusesOutOfContract" "internal/codegen/moo/ludicrous_test.go TestMooLudicrousWire: ludicrous_state, ludicrous_state_untargeted, degenerate_probe and unsigned_probe goldens, fixed and 128-bit hostile offsets" "internal/codegen/moo/analyze_test.go TestMooGeneratedCodeIsAnalyzerClean and its negative control TestMooAnalyzerGateNegativeControl" "make packet-defaults-moo (test/packet-defaults/moo/main.moo): constructors, Init and Zero, explicit-empty and short literals, the 33/64-bit masks, the defaultless twin, backing storage and repeated union selection, and the eight C++ byte and bit pins of testdata/wire/packet-defaults read back at their consumed bits; its control packet-defaults-moo-negative-control fails the constructor-bytes marker" "make packet-finite-moo (test/packet-finite/moo/main.moo): NaN and the infinities refused at every float slot on write (unlatched false) and read (non_finite_float), -0 and the subnormals bit exact; packet-finite-moo-negative-control fails exactly read.expected (63 vectors) and write.expected (35)" "make packet-utf8-moo (test/packet-text/moo/main.moo): 33 pinned string corpus rows and 496 bit flips agree with the C++ oracle; packet-utf8-moo-negative-control fails bit-flip agreement" "make packet-wide-moo (test/packet-wide/moo/contracts.moo and main.moo): the composition contracts, 32 pinned wstring rows and 1,016 bit flips agree with the C++ oracle; packet-wide-moo-negative-control fails bit-flip agreement" "internal/goldens TestGoldenPacketWideSource pins testdata/golden/packet-wide/moo/WideText.moo") :note "Every packet row against the shared wire vectors and the packet-text (#519), packet-wide (#188), packet-defaults (#396) and packet-finite gates with their negative controls, all under make test-moo. The controls run under test-moo (certify make test); the negative-controls matrix row for moo is layer 7's (make/negative-controls.json excludes them with that reason until then). packet-void is C and C++ only for every port.")
  (:id "port/lobster/packet" :type :task :title "Lobster packet leg: the examples against the shared wire vectors" :state :doing :evidence nil :note "The type wire's write path is landed (TestLobsterTypeWireWritesTheGoldens writes the 14 instances of testdata/wire/*.bin byte for byte; TestLobsterTypeWireWriteNegativeControl). The read path on serialize.lobster v2.1.1 is owed (a sibling worker 2026-10-28).")
