  (:id "schema-cards-out-2026-10-19" :type :work-set :title "Schema cards moved out of the sprint 2026-10-19" :note "Moved out of the sprint on 2026-10-19 (Glenn: \"Please take all work in the current sprint that is not for this rocketnet release and push it out to the appropriate roadmap sexp and regenerate ROADMAP.md per-repo with progress so far.\"). Every unlanded card of the twelve schema streams (schema-go, schema-shared, schema-c-cpp, schema-cs, schema-rust, schema-java, schema-js, schema-dart, schema-elixir, schema-luau, schema-lua, schema-squirrel), one task per card, grouped by stream: 331 waiting cards deferred with nova-sprint defer, and 74 cards in review or ready, whose pushed heads are named in :pushed-head and :pushed-branch and stay on those branches. Each task names its task statement in :task and keeps the card's whole brief in the file :brief-file names (docs/roadmap-briefs/schema-cards-out-2026-10-19.sexp, data the renderer does not read, kept apart so this file stays under the renderer's 5 MB bound). None is landed and none is started here; the landed cards of these streams are in git on their stream bases (sprint/schema-<lang>), and the roadmap rows they proved are recorded in docs/roadmap-evidence/sprint-landed-2026-10-19.sexp. These tasks are not cells of the three tables above. Later on 2026-10-19 (Glenn: \"Please bring the other schema languages into the sprint as well. Lua, Luau, Squirrel\") the schema-luau, schema-lua and schema-squirrel cards went back into the sprint under new ids (each old id plus -r), and their items were removed from this work-set and from the brief file." :origin "cards from the sprint store (2026-10-19, epoch 21)" :children ("sprint-out-2026-10-19/schema-go" "sprint-out-2026-10-19/schema-shared" "sprint-out-2026-10-19/schema-c-cpp" "sprint-out-2026-10-19/schema-cs" "sprint-out-2026-10-19/schema-rust" "sprint-out-2026-10-19/schema-java" "sprint-out-2026-10-19/schema-js" "sprint-out-2026-10-19/schema-dart" "sprint-out-2026-10-19/schema-elixir"))
