  (:id "sprint-out/schema-spec-pin-guard-onto-dev" :type :task :title "The spec-pins guard re-pinned onto dev (held off dev at the schema-shared landing)" :state :todo :evidence nil :tier "pro" :note "Held 2026-10-21 when sprint/schema-shared (464c8c4f9) landed on dev: the landed cards schema-spec-pin-design-row-ids, -s0, -s34, -s45, -s6, -s7 and -guard-nested-modules-and-tiers were cut against an older SPEC-TABLES.md and an older roadmap. On dev the guard is red with about 860 normative sentences dev added since (the `| required` marker, 2.11 timestamps, 2.12 forms, the strict and tolerant reads, the json value and array constructs) and with no pin or owed entry for 648 rows in each of the three new roadmap ports lua, luau and squirrel. So the guard (internal/ci/schema_spec_pin_*_test.go), its make fragments and workflows, the Row ids and pins section and the row markers stay off dev; the asserting tests those cards wrote (compiler/schema_spec_pin_s0_test.go, internal/check/schema_spec_pin_s0_test.go and the repinned tests) landed. The work: restore the guard from sprint/schema-shared, re-mark dev's new sentences or owe them by section, and owe or pin every row in lua, luau and squirrel.")
